<title>USA: Massachusetts $200 mln GO bonds won by Goldman.</title>
<headline>Massachusetts $200 mln GO bonds won by Goldman.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co said it won $200 million of Massachusetts general obligation bonds with a true interest cost (TIC) of 5.5428 percent.</p>
<p>Smith Barney Inc had the cover bid of a 5.5429 percent.</p>
